## Q3. Cache lines (128 B) touched by the feature-weight lookups of build h's layout, per scored address (development split)

Scored addresses: 10,305 (bypassed: 3). Scope: state + transition dictionary probes (slots, arena keys) and CSR rows (indptr, indices, data). Excluded: vocabulary dictionary, phrase/postal tries, normalization, the per-address state matrices (so this is a floor for the lookup path only).

| Quantity per address | mean | median | P10 | P90 | max |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| nS | 45.9 | 43 | 27 | 66 | 246 |
| nP | 8.7 | 8 | 6 | 12 | 40 |
| touches | 452.3 | 429 | 281 | 641 | 2586 |
| distinct | 270.0 | 264 | 172 | 377 | 1021 |
| d_slot | 55.0 | 52 | 35 | 77 | 307 |
| d_arena | 44.0 | 42 | 25 | 65 | 181 |
| d_indptr | 23.5 | 22 | 15 | 33 | 104 |
| d_indices | 58.0 | 57 | 36 | 80 | 201 |
| d_data | 89.5 | 88 | 55 | 125 | 303 |
| compulsory | 57.5 | 49 | 13 | 108 | 620 |
| miss_128K | 181.6 | 170 | 88 | 288 | 989 |
| miss_16M | 76.4 | 67 | 30 | 133 | 620 |
| miss_32M | 65.1 | 57 | 19 | 118 | 620 |
| miss_64M | 57.8 | 50 | 14 | 108 | 620 |

Totals: lookups 562,743; line touches 4,661,394; sum of per-address distinct lines 2,782,124; distinct lines over the whole split (compulsory) 592,742; LRU misses at 16 MiB 787,683 (0.283 of per-address distinct).
miss_X = touches whose exact LRU stack distance over this stream is >= X (or first touch); the stream is ONLY these lookups, so real caches (shared with all other parser data) would miss more.

Little's law floor, T_mem_min = N * lambda / M_max with lambda = 127.2 ns and M_max = 29.7 (Q2):

| N used | N (mean per address) | T_mem_min us | share of 13.22 us |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| distinct lines per address (every address starts cold) | 270.0 | 1.156 | 8.7% |
| LRU misses at 16 MiB (lookup stream only) | 76.4 | 0.327 | 2.5% |
| LRU misses at 64 MiB | 57.8 | 0.247 | 1.9% |

With no overlap at all (M = 1): distinct lines x lambda = 34.34 us per address.
